Package: xios-runtime
Name: Xios Application Runtime
Version: 0.1.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), iosc (>= 0.9.41), angle (>= 2.1.0+git20260630.a32d31d+es3-15), dbus, xios-desktop-defaults, xios-audio-server, xios-fhs (>= 1.0.5), pulseaudio (>= 17.0-7+ios2), pulseaudio-utils (>= 17.0-7+ios2)
Recommends: xios-desktop-theme
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0.0
Description: shared Linux application runtime for Xios
 The shell-independent runtime used by every Xios presentation model: the iosc
 Wayland compositor, ANGLE GPU stack, D-Bus, desktop audio, filesystem and
 hardware bridges, and ambient desktop defaults such as fonts, locale, XDG
 paths, and retina display settings.
 .
 This package deliberately contains no Xios display app, desktop shell, session
 launcher, privileged Home Screen launcher service, or flavor-specific desktop
 environment. Install a Xios flavor package rather than this package directly.
 .
 Rootless jailbreaks only (/var/jb).
